5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I feel we should look at why our timelines often slip. Perhaps the site diaries or delivery schedules would be enlightening?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I agree! I'm also curious about how rooms are actually used. Maybe booking data and timetable records?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,We shouldn't forget the people. I'd like to see the staffing posts and the technicians' manual routines.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,User satisfaction is key. I suggest post-occupancy review ratings and the survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A logical approach requires financial context. I'll examine the tender records and the renewal reserves for equipment.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Yumi, those are wonderful suggestions. I think understanding the timetable pressure is very kind to the students.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, you're right about the staff! I hope we can find a way to help them.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,pass,George,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
