60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"Looking at the candidates, the Path Network is too weather-dependent. The Study Commons seems the safest for the schedule.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Yumi,,I strongly support the Study Commons. It addresses the shortage of general rooms and the booking demand.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,The Laboratory Ventilation Upgrade would help my technicians immensely. It's a priority for staff welfare.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,The Media Center is too specialist. The Study Commons fits the post-occupancy success patterns perfectly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,The Ventilation Upgrade is a financial risk due to mechanical cost trends. The Commons is more stable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@George, I sympathize, but can we risk the ""comfort"" delay associated with the Commons? It's better than the paths.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Yumi,,"@George, would the ventilation work take rooms out of service? If so, the rental costs would be huge.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"It would, but the current manual burden is unsustainable. We can't ignore the staff forever.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@George, the Commons is a conversion of an underused hall. It minimizes disruption and maximizes utility.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Logically, the Commons offers the best ratio of low financial risk to high user benefit.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. The Commons avoids the weather and the most volatile cost increases.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Yumi,,It's the most energetic choice for the students! I'm voting for the Commons.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"I still worry about the labs, but I see the logic regarding the budget and the timetable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,It's the most inclusive option. I'm certain it's the right choice.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I concur. The risk profile of the other three is simply too high.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
